<title>USA: Aracruz Celulose nine-month ADR/shr falls.</title>
<headline>Aracruz Celulose nine-month ADR/shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>For nine-months ending September 30</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.74		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net			 79,600		  304,800</p>
<p> Revs		     373,894		  602,343</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 454,908		  454,908</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's earnings per ADR for the current nine-month period was $0.37, compared to $1.42 for the year-ago period,  </p>
<p>Full company name is Aracruz Celulose S.A.</p>
